    "body": "Analysis complained on the sender side that it might overflow. In practice this could never happen.\n\n<!-- Reviewable:start -->\n- - -\nThis change is [<img src=\"https://reviewable.io/review_button.svg\" height=\"34\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Reviewable\"/>](https://reviewable.io/reviews/TokTok/c-toxcore/3048)\n<!-- Reviewable:end -->\n",
    "changed_files": 5,
    "closed_at": "2026-05-23T13:24:01Z",
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
                "html": {
                    "href": "https://github.com/TokTok/c-toxcore/pull/3048#discussion_r3281428478"
