                }
            },
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Here. `PACKED_NODE_SIZE_IP6 * 2` means 2 ipport + 2 pubkeys.\r\nThis is for ipport of the direct peer connection AND node info for relay (which really is ipport + pubkey).\r\nThe pubkey for the direct peer info is already at the start of the macro `ENC_PUBLIC_KEY_SIZE`, so we accounted for that twice.",
            "commit_id": "5080b21ca5fe2404cba70139fc3cf19dd3992127",
            "created_at": "2026-05-21T13:16:08Z",
            "diff_hunk": "@@ -35,7 +35,7 @@ extern \"C\" {\n #define GCA_MAX_SENT_ANNOUNCES 4\n \n /* Maximum size of an announce. */\n-#define GCA_ANNOUNCE_MAX_SIZE (ENC_PUBLIC_KEY_SIZE + 1 + 1 + (PACKED_NODE_SIZE_IP6 * 2))\n+#define GCA_ANNOUNCE_MAX_SIZE (ENC_PUBLIC_KEY_SIZE + 1 + 1 + (1 + SIZE_IP6 + sizeof(uint16_t)) + PACKED_NODE_SIZE_IP6)",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/TokTok/c-toxcore/pull/3048#discussion_r3281428478",
